{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/103674-shih-warriors","id":103674,"title":"Shih Warriors","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-01T15:36:23-07:00","id":103674,"title":"Shih Warriors","content":"Just kinda curious, am I the only one who thinks it would have been cool to port them from OWoD's Demon Hunter X to NWoD's Hunter: The Vigil and possibly loose the &quot;Asian Only&quot; flavor to them? <br /> <br /> Or hell, has anyone tried their hand at home brewing this into a Conspiracy yet, if so can I get pointed in the right direction?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'll be your Huckleberry","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2397-the-dude","name":"The Dude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-01T15:51:59-07:00","id":103686,"title":"","content":"The entire purpose of Shi was to provide mechanical framework for a syncretic Daoist-Buddhist-and-sometimes-other-systems East Asian demon hunter as seen in fiction, so I'm wondering what you're hoping to strip off of the concept. Loosing some parts of it would be like discarding references to saints for the MM Endowments, after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-01T16:25:28-07:00","id":103698,"title":"","content":"Posted below is a rough draft of the Shih as a hunter compact. I am probably going to revise some of the material to be GMC compatible, but let me know what you think over all.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B8VmJEQkvYuwbGwyZ3laTk15QmM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B8VmJEQkvYuwbGwyZ3laTk15QmM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B8VmJEQkvYuwbGwyZ3laTk15QmM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B8VmJEQkvYuwbGwyZ3laTk15QmM/edit?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420009-the-artificer-s-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">The Artificer's Workshop</a> - A collection of Exalted Artifacts<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\" target=\"_blank\">Curios, Relics, and Tomes</a> - A collection of Relics (Cursed and Otherwise)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show\" target=\"_blank\">The Horror Lab</a> - A collection of Beasts, Monsters and less definable things.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1128197-strange-places#post1128197\" target=\"_blank\">Strange Places</a> - A collection of Dark, Mysterious, and Wondrous Locations<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie\" target=\"_blank\">Twilight Menagerie</a> - A collection of Ephemeral Entities","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell","name":"Reighnhell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"749"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-01T16:43:27-07:00","id":103710,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/103674-shih-warriors?p=103686#post103686\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The entire purpose of Shi was to provide mechanical framework for a syncretic Daoist-Buddhist-and-sometimes-other-systems East Asian demon hunter as seen in fiction, so I'm wondering what you're hoping to strip off of the concept. Loosing some parts of it would be like discarding references to saints for the MM Endowments, after all.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not hoping to strip away a core aspect of the Shih Warriors, simply acknowledge that the world has become a bigger place and the people who's culture they sprang from have managed to move out of Asia and spread across the world, so it should stand to reason that the Shih are not limited either.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'll be your Huckleberry","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2397-the-dude","name":"The Dude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-01T20:57:36-07:00","id":103815,"title":"","content":"I really like the Shih. If I were to convert them I would use their Qiao or Martial arts as their Endowment. I would also have starting characters play as Shih Apprentices. They are a conspiracy, and being an actual Shih I would put at Status 4 or 5. In CWOD they took 20 years of Training or so to graduate as a independent Shih.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-01T21:13:02-07:00","id":103822,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Dude</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/103674-shih-warriors?p=103710#post103710\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not hoping to strip away a core aspect of the Shih Warriors, simply acknowledge that the world has become a bigger place and the people who's culture they sprang from have managed to move out of Asia and spread across the world, so it should stand to reason that the Shih are not limited either.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just so long as it's still training from hell and mastery of traditional calligraphy to produce prayer talismans.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-02T11:17:11-07:00","id":104187,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/103674-shih-warriors?p=103815#post103815\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I really like the Shih. If I were to convert them I would use their Qiao or Martial arts as their Endowment. I would also have starting characters play as Shih Apprentices. They are a conspiracy, and being an actual Shih I would put at Status 4 or 5. In CWOD they took 20 years of Training or so to graduate as a independent Shih.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would Mo Chi Kung Fu just as it is in the above link, Some techniques being Physical Merits reflective of training, and some of them being a part of a fighting style merit while leaving the Quio's as their Endowments. <br /> <br /> The issue with having them start as Shih Apprentices and working their way to independent Shih would be the simple fact that while it is not unheard of, Shih Warriors rarely took adults as students as while what happened to them is horrible, it does not leave them unable to survive in the world, only when they swear an oath of vengeance against what did this, and the Shih believes it to be true, does he really take an adult. They tend to take children as the children will be left to the system or otherwise unable to fend for themselves, and in this cruel world nobody is going to adopt a child who talks about monsters who killed their parents and won't stop despite the treatment that the doctors give them, they would even eventually be institutionalized, so taking them and training them in this harsh world lets them both know that they are not in fact insane, and adds another warrior to the cause. Another reason they took children is that their body is able to more readily recover from the harsh training (That yes Saur Ops Specialist I would insist remains) that they have to go through (Anyone who doubts this I want you to go out right now and try to do some of the same stupid shit you did as a kid, see if it doesn't hurt worse and/or take longer to recover *lol), and are able to withstand the mental training as well, as their minds have not yet been set on the idea of what is real, and what is not. <br /> <br /> So by the time their 18 (The general approved age for online play, and fairly common starting age for TT characters as well though not as often a hard set rule for TT), they're more often than not, half way through their training. Take into account that during their training, the &quot;Status 1 &amp; 2&quot; time periods of their training are often the harsh physical training they go through and it wouldn't be until late status 2, possibly even status 3 (I'm going based on a general timeline assumption for each status dot) that they actually get to go out, on their own and engage a target.<br /> <br /> Than there is the final issue with that, playing a Shih Warrior who must start off as an apprentice than REQUIRES that he have a Mentor, and this puts the burden of training your character and giving your character extra attention based on this fact, onto your Storyteller. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'll be your Huckleberry","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2397-the-dude","name":"The Dude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}